<title>USA: Group has International Technology stake.</title>
<headline>Group has International Technology stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including Mequon, Wisc., investment fund managers Brian Stark and Michael Roth said Wednesday it has acquired 2,213,602 shares of International Technology Corp., or 5.75 percent of the total.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it bought the shares for investment purposes.</p>
